    "created_at": "2022-03-31T06:32:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-31T06:32:43Z",
    "body": "The issue was explained to me in this crbug comment: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1309901#c7\r\n\r\nThe summary is that if the `request.mode` is 'no-cors', then `request.credentials` must be set to 'omit' in the serviceworker before actually making the request. Here's a fixed version for reference:\r\n\r\n* https://glitch.com/edit/#!/coep-credentialless-with-serviceworker-fixed\r\n* https://coep-credentialless-with-serviceworker-fixed.glitch.me/\r\n",
